00:02:11.219 --> 00:02:15.553
And obviously with what's
going on with COVID,

00:02:15.553 --> 00:02:17.682
the macro esports landscape

00:02:17.682 --> 00:02:20.106
is getting more and more attention.

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:21.780
And obviously we have a format

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.973
where people do travel and we do have fans

00:02:24.973 --> 00:02:26.356
and we had the opening weekend,

00:02:26.356 --> 00:02:28.094
so we've been affected in that way.

00:02:28.094 --> 00:02:31.344
But the infrastructure of
our game obviously scales

00:02:31.344 --> 00:02:33.288
to this new world.

00:02:33.288 --> 00:02:36.857
What's been the biggest observations

00:02:36.857 --> 00:02:39.162
