00:03:13.024 --> 00:03:16.701
how has it been to be a
commissioner of a sport?

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.398
It's kind of neat, like...

00:03:18.398 --> 00:03:20.448
- Oh, it's the best!

00:03:20.448 --> 00:03:22.226
I know you--
- Go ahead.

00:03:22.226 --> 00:03:24.978
- I know we talk about this a lot,

00:03:24.978 --> 00:03:26.194
just being a part of sports

00:03:26.194 --> 00:03:27.562
and whether you want to own a team

00:03:27.562 --> 00:03:30.314
or be on the league ops side,

00:03:30.314 --> 00:03:33.106
but to be able to head
this up is just an honor.

00:03:33.106 --> 00:03:33.994
It's incredible.

00:03:33.994 --> 00:03:35.530
- What's been the biggest challenge

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:38.818
and what's been kind of
the most pleasant surprise,

00:03:38.818 --> 00:03:40.480
just out of my own curiosity?

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:42.430
- I would definitely say
the biggest challenge is,

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:46.216
I think as you know, "Call of
Duty" is a monster franchise.

00:03:46.216 --> 00:03:49.164
It's been around for
so long and the esport

00:03:49.164 --> 00:03:51.232
has been around for a
really long time, right?

00:03:51.232 --> 00:03:54.066
So there was already these
built in expectations,

00:03:54.066 --> 00:03:56.422
built in ways of doing things,

00:03:56.422 --> 00:03:58.721
rituals, traditions, the whole nine

00:03:58.721 --> 00:04:00.499
that you really have to
respect when you come in.

00:04:00.499 --> 00:04:04.095
This is not a brand new,
never-been-done-before,

00:04:04.095 --> 00:04:05.390
different proposition for the league.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:07.083
So we were rebooting,

00:04:07.083 --> 00:04:08.132
but we also had to marry that

00:04:08.132 --> 00:04:10.965
within honoring the legacy
of where we've been,

00:04:10.965 --> 00:04:13.148
so I think that's been
an interesting challenge

00:04:13.148 --> 00:04:15.481
and one that we've embraced.

00:04:16.909 --> 00:04:19.980
Biggest surprises, we've got
everyone around the horn.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.028
Yourself, we've got some of the

00:04:22.028 --> 00:04:23.995
biggest name celebrities
coming through the doors,

00:04:23.995 --> 00:04:28.495
we've got these incredible
competitors from the scene,

00:04:29.634 --> 00:04:31.879
both new names from pros who are gonna

00:04:31.879 --> 00:04:33.247
make their mark going forward,

00:04:33.247 --> 00:04:35.799
pros who've been, again, in
the scene for many years.

00:04:35.799 --> 00:04:38.951
So I would just say
it's the amount of faces

00:04:38.951 --> 00:04:42.511
and interest level in what we're doing,

00:04:42.511 --> 00:04:45.223
from people who've known
about it for a long time,

00:04:45.223 --> 00:04:46.879
people who are just getting involved,

00:04:46.879 --> 00:04:49.143
people coming in from traditional sports.

00:04:49.143 --> 00:04:52.383
It's really a interesting
convergence, I'd say,

00:04:52.383 --> 00:04:54.159
of a lot of different industries.

00:04:54.159 --> 00:04:54.992
- I love it.

00:04:54.992 --> 00:04:55.825
Well, it's great to see your face.

00:04:55.825 --> 00:04:58.311
Any questions before I move on here?

00:04:58.311 --> 00:05:00.535
- No, it's just great to
see you, are you well?

00:05:00.535 --> 00:05:01.368
- I am well.

00:05:01.368 --> 00:05:04.703
You know, just navigating through this...

00:05:04.703 --> 00:05:06.727
The first three, four,
five weeks was really about

00:05:06.727 --> 00:05:08.839
a) make sure family's okay,

00:05:08.839 --> 00:05:11.871
just really quantifying the disease

00:05:11.871 --> 00:05:13.895
and then very, very quickly,

00:05:13.895 --> 00:05:15.991
within the first couple days of it,

00:05:15.991 --> 00:05:18.919
there's seven companies
under my holding company

00:05:18.919 --> 00:05:19.927
that I'm a CEO of,

00:05:19.927 --> 00:05:22.511
I'm the CEO of the
biggest company within it.

00:05:22.511 --> 00:05:25.575
So, just navigating some of
that world while also navigating

00:05:25.575 --> 00:05:27.519
through just getting
crushed in public speaking,

00:05:27.519 --> 00:05:29.932
like all of that revenue's gone.

00:05:29.932 --> 00:05:31.815
You know, wartime general shit.

00:05:31.815 --> 00:05:33.315
- Sure.
- You know?

00:05:34.816 --> 00:05:36.383
I think a lot of people signed up for

00:05:36.383 --> 00:05:37.879
entrepreneurship over the last decade

00:05:37.879 --> 00:05:38.807
'cause it was cool and seemed easy and fun

00:05:38.807 --> 00:05:40.474
and the thing to do,

00:05:41.981 --> 00:05:44.452
and I think a lot of
people are experiencing,

00:05:44.452 --> 00:05:46.311
especially if you're under
32 and you have a business,

00:05:46.311 --> 00:05:50.116
you're experiencing for the
first time a punch in the gut,

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:51.582
and really navigating it.

00:05:51.582 --> 00:05:53.725
And it's been a fun challenge.

00:05:53.725 --> 00:05:55.183
- Yeah, well good luck with it.

00:05:55.183 --> 00:05:56.016
- Thank you.

00:05:56.016 --> 00:05:57.083
- Good luck this weekend to the Rocker,

00:05:57.083 --> 00:05:58.299
we're all really excited to see it.

00:05:58.299 --> 00:05:59.310
- Thank you, we're excited about it.

00:05:59.310 --> 00:06:00.143
- All right.
- All right, Johanna.

00:06:00.143 --> 00:06:00.976
Take care.
- Take care, bye.

